       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI99900.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI99900.                                    *
      *                                                                *
      *     Total Movim./Correspondente
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       DATA DIVISION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI99900         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5805 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE TBCDCCBC END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV9990.
       COPY SWCV9991.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.
       COPY ARCK0002.
      *
       COPY SXCL0790.
       COPY ARCL0039.
       COPY ETCL0002.
       COPY VIAW0020.
       COPY TGCL1000.
       COPY SXCL0002.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            SWITCH
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  SW-SWITCH.
           05 SW-CURSOR                  PIC X(01) VALUE SPACES.
              88 SW-CURSOR-NONE                    VALUE '0'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-1                       VALUE '1'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-2                       VALUE '2'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-3                       VALUE '3'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-4                       VALUE '3'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-NCCCBCOR PIC X(08) VALUE 'NCCCBCOR'.
           05 CON-SWVT5805 PIC X(08) VALUE 'SWVT5805'.
           05 CON-BANC-MIN PIC X(04) VALUE '    '.
           05 CON-BANC-MAX PIC X(04) VALUE '9999'.
           05 CON-SEND-MIN PIC X(02) VALUE '  '.
           05 CON-SEND-MAX PIC X(02) VALUE '99'.
           05 CON-VALIDO   PIC X(01) VALUE 'V'.
      *
           05 CON-PD       PIC X(02) VALUE 'PD'.
           05 CON-RS       PIC X(02) VALUE 'RS'.
           05 CON-RC       PIC X(02) VALUE 'RC'.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME     PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI99900'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *              DECLARACOES DE CURSORES DB2                     *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-SQL-AUXILIARY.
           05 IND-NULL                  PIC S9(04)    BINARY.
      *
       01  WS-CURSOR-VARS.
           05 WS-CSEND.
              10 WS-CBAN                 PIC  X(04)  VALUE SPACES.
              10 WS-CSPAI                PIC  X(02)  VALUE SPACES.
              10 FILLER                  PIC  X(09)  VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-BANC-MIN  PIC X(04) VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-BANC-MAX  PIC X(04) VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-SEND-MIN  PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-SEND-MAX  PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-COUNT                  PIC S9(09)V   COMP-3.
           05 WS-SUM                    PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
           05 WS-CODEST1                PIC  X(02)    VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-CODEST2                PIC  X(02)    VALUE SPACES.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              DECLARE CURSWT01 CURSOR FOR
                 SELECT NCCCCBAN
                      , NCCCCSPAI
                   FROM NCCCBCOR
                  WHERE NCCCCBAN   BETWEEN :WS-BANC-MIN
                                       AND :WS-BANC-MAX
                    AND NCCCCSPAI  BETWEEN :WS-SEND-MIN
                                       AND :WS-SEND-MAX
                    AND NCCCCBAN   <> " "
                    AND NCCCCSPAI  <> " "
      * PAG
                    AND (     NCCCCBAN   >  :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN
                          OR  NCCCCBAN   =  :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN
                          AND NCCCCSPAI  >= :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI
                    )
                  GROUP
                     BY NCCCCBAN
                      , NCCCCSPAI
                  ORDER
                     BY NCCCCBAN
                      , NCCCCSPAI
           END-EXEC.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                        PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI99900         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *
       COPY VIAL0004.
      *
            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV9990-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV9990-ASE               TO SWCV9991-ASE.
      *
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCV9991-INDICE.
           PERFORM 1100-LIMPA-OCCURS
              THRU 1199-LIMPA-OCCURS-EXIT
             UNTIL SWCV9991-PAGINA-CHEIA.
      *
       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1100-LIMPA-OCCURS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1100-LIMPA-OCCURS.
      *
           ADD 1                       TO SWCV9991-INDICE.
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9991-D-CSEND(SWCV9991-INDICE)
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9991-D-DESCSEND(SWCV9991-INDICE)
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO SWCV9991-D-TOPREC(SWCV9991-INDICE)
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO SWCV9991-D-TOPPEND(SWCV9991-INDICE)
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9991-D-CBAN(SWCV9991-INDICE)
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9991-D-CSPAI(SWCV9991-INDICE).
      *
       1199-LIMPA-OCCURS-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCV9990-NOMEFXLS          TO SWCV9991-NOMEFXLS
           MOVE SWCV9990-NMAXLIST          TO SWCV9991-NMAXLIST
           MOVE SWCV9990-CSEND-PAG         TO SWCV9991-CSEND-PAG
           MOVE SWCV9990-CBAN-PAG          TO SWCV9991-CBAN-PAG
           MOVE SWCV9990-CSPAI-PAG         TO SWCV9991-CSPAI-PAG
           MOVE SWCV9990-CSEND             TO SWCV9991-CSEND
           MOVE SWCV9990-CBAN              TO SWCV9991-CBAN
           MOVE SWCV9990-CSPAI             TO SWCV9991-CSPAI
      *
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2100-VAL-TAB-BM004
                 THRU 2100-VAL-TAB-BM004-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 2010-VALIDACOES
              THRU 2019-VALIDACOES-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2020-OPEN
                 THRU 2029-OPEN-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2030-FETCH
                 THRU 2039-FETCH-EXIT

              IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
                 IF DB2-OK
                    PERFORM 2040-CONTINUA
                       THRU 2049-CONTINUA-EXIT
                 ELSE
                    COMPUTE SWCV9991-DIMINUI-LENGTH EQUAL
                         SWCV9991-INDICE-INVERSO * SWCV9991-LENGTH-OCCUR
                    COMPUTE SWCV9991-LENGTH EQUAL SWCV9991-LENGTH
                         - SWCV9991-DIMINUI-LENGTH
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                                           TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV9991-CBAN-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-CBAN-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV9991-CBAN-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV9991-CBAN-CAPLIC
                 END-IF
              END-IF
              PERFORM 2070-CLOSE
                 THRU 2079-CLOSE-EXIT
           END-IF.


       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2010-VALIDACOES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2010-VALIDACOES.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2010-VALIDACOES' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.


           CONTINUE.

       2019-VALIDACOES-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2020-OPEN
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2020-OPEN.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2020-OPEN' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV9990-CBAN-PAG          TO SWCV9990-CBAN
                                              NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN
           MOVE SWCV9990-CSPAI-PAG         TO SWCV9990-CSPAI
                                              NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI
      * FILTROS
           IF SWCV9990-CSEND     EQUAL SPACES
              MOVE CON-BANC-MIN    TO WS-BANC-MIN
              MOVE CON-BANC-MAX    TO WS-BANC-MAX
              MOVE CON-SEND-MIN    TO WS-SEND-MIN
              MOVE CON-SEND-MAX    TO WS-SEND-MAX
           ELSE
              MOVE SWCV9990-CSEND(1:4)  TO  WS-BANC-MIN
                                            WS-BANC-MAX
              MOVE SWCV9990-CSEND(5:2)  TO  WS-SEND-MIN
                                            WS-SEND-MAX
           END-IF.

           SET SW-CURSOR-NONE TO TRUE

           IF SW-CURSOR-NONE
              SET SW-CURSOR-1 TO TRUE
           END-IF

           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN SW-CURSOR-1
                    EXEC SQL
                        OPEN CURSWT01
                    END-EXEC
           END-EVALUATE.

           MOVE CON-NCCCBCOR               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

       2029-OPEN-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2030-FETCH
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2030-FETCH.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2030-FETCH' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN SW-CURSOR-1
                  EXEC SQL
                     FETCH CURSWT01
                      INTO :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN
                         , :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI
                    END-EXEC

           END-EVALUATE.

           MOVE CON-NCCCBCOR               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2030-FETCH' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              MOVE 'SQLCODE'               TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(1)
              MOVE  SQLCODE                TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
       2039-FETCH-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                       2040-CONTINUA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2040-CONTINUA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2040-CONTINUA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCV9991-INDICE.
           PERFORM 2050-TRATA-OCCURS
              THRU 2059-TRATA-OCCURS-EXIT
             UNTIL DB2-NOTFND
                OR SWCV9991-PAGINA-CHEIA
                OR NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS.
      *
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF NOT SWCV9991-PAGINA-CHEIA
                    COMPUTE SWCV9991-INDICE-INVERSO EQUAL
                         SWCV9991-INDICE-INVERSO - SWCV9991-INDICE
                    COMPUTE SWCV9991-DIMINUI-LENGTH EQUAL
                         SWCV9991-INDICE-INVERSO * SWCV9991-LENGTH-OCCUR
                    COMPUTE SWCV9991-LENGTH EQUAL SWCV9991-LENGTH -
                         SWCV9991-DIMINUI-LENGTH
                    SET  VIAL0002-FIM-CONSULTA TO TRUE
              END-IF
              IF DB2-NOTFND
                    SET  VIAL0002-FIM-CONSULTA TO TRUE
              END-IF
           END-IF.
      *
       2049-CONTINUA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2050-TRATA-OCCURS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2050-TRATA-OCCURS.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2050-TRATA-OCCURS' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           ADD 1                       TO SWCV9991-INDICE.
      *
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN      TO WS-CBAN .
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI     TO WS-CSPAI.
      *
           MOVE WS-CSEND
             TO SWCV9991-D-CSEND(SWCV9991-INDICE).
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN
             TO SWCV9991-D-CBAN(SWCV9991-INDICE).
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI
             TO SWCV9991-D-CSPAI(SWCV9991-INDICE).
      *
      *  OBTEM SOMATORIOS
           MOVE CON-RS                     TO WS-CODEST1.
           MOVE CON-RC                     TO WS-CODEST2.
           PERFORM 2310-OBTEM-COUNT-SUM
              THRU 2310-OBTEM-COUNT-SUM-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-COUNT
             TO SWCV9991-D-TOPREC(SWCV9991-INDICE).
           MOVE CON-PD                     TO WS-CODEST1.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO WS-CODEST2.
           PERFORM 2310-OBTEM-COUNT-SUM
              THRU 2310-OBTEM-COUNT-SUM-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-COUNT
             TO SWCV9991-D-TOPPEND(SWCV9991-INDICE).
      *
           PERFORM 2320-DESC-CSEND
              THRU 2320-DESC-CSEND-EXIT
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2050-TRATA-OCCURS'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 2030-FETCH
              THRU 2039-FETCH-EXIT.
      *
       2059-TRATA-OCCURS-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2310-OBTEM-COUNT-SUM
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2310-OBTEM-COUNT-SUM.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2310-OBTEM-COUNT-SUM. ' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO WS-COUNT.
      *
           EXEC SQL
                SELECT COUNT(*)
                  INTO :WS-COUNT
                  FROM SWVT5805
                 WHERE CCODEST IN (:WS-CODEST1, :WS-CODEST2)
                   AND CBAN  = :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN
                   AND CSPAI = :NCCCBCOR-NCCCCSPAI
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-SWVT5805               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           MOVE SPACES                     TO WS-CODEST1.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO WS-CODEST2.
      *
       2310-OBTEM-COUNT-SUM-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2320-DESC-CSEND
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2320-DESC-CSEND.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2320-DESC-CSEND    ' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           INITIALIZE SXCL0790-DATA
                      SXCL0002-COMMAREA.

           MOVE VIAL0001-VERSAO-SYS    TO SXCL0790-VERSAO
           MOVE NCCCBCOR-NCCCCBAN      TO SXCL0790-BCBAN
           MOVE CON-VALIDO             TO SXCL0790-BSITU
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2320-DESC-CSEND      ' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              MOVE 'SXCL0790-BCBAN       ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(1)
              MOVE  SXCL0790-BCBAN         TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
              MOVE 'SXCL0790-BSITU       ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(2)
              MOVE  SXCL0790-BSITU         TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(2)
              MOVE 'SXCL0790-RCODE       ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(3)
              MOVE  SXCL0790-RCODE         TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(3)
              MOVE 'SXCL0790-BDBAN       ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(4)
              MOVE  SXCL0790-BDBAN         TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(4)
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM CALL-SXRM0790
              THRU CALL-SXRM0790-EXIT.

           MOVE SXCL0790-RCODE         TO VIAW0020-RCODE

           PERFORM VIAP0020-TRATA-RCODE
              THRU VIAP0020-TRATA-RCODE-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              MOVE SXCL0790-BDBAN
                         TO SWCV9991-D-DESCSEND(SWCV9991-INDICE)
           END-IF.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2320-DESC-CSEND      ' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              MOVE 'SXCL0790-BCBAN       ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(1)
              MOVE  SXCL0790-BCBAN         TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
              MOVE 'SXCL0790-BSITU       ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(2)
              MOVE  SXCL0790-BSITU         TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(2)
              MOVE 'SXCL0790-RCODE       ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(3)
              MOVE  SXCL0790-RCODE         TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(3)
              MOVE 'SXCL0790-BDBAN       ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(4)
              MOVE  SXCL0790-BDBAN         TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(4)
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       2320-DESC-CSEND-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2070-CLOSE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2070-CLOSE.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2070-CLOSE' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN SW-CURSOR-1
                    EXEC SQL
                        CLOSE CURSWT01
                    END-EXEC
           END-EVALUATE.

       2079-CLOSE-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2100-VAL-TAB-BM004
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-VAL-TAB-BM004.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-VAL-TAB-BM004' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           INITIALIZE TGCL1000-MSG       REPLACING  NUMERIC BY ZEROES
                                               ALPHANUMERIC BY SPACES.

           MOVE ARCK0002-BM004-CORRESP  TO TGCL1000-CTABELA
           MOVE SWCV9990-CSEND          TO TGCL1000-CCOD

           PERFORM CALL-TGCP1000
              THRU CALL-TGCP1000-EXIT.

           IF NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              MOVE TGCL1000-CCOD-S         TO SWCV9991-CSEND-S
              MOVE TGCL1000-CCOD-CAPLIC    TO SWCV9991-CSEND-CAPLIC
              MOVE TGCL1000-CCOD-MSG       TO SWCV9991-CSEND-PAG-MSG
              MOVE TGCL1000-GDESC          TO SWCV9991-XDESCCSEND
           ELSE
             MOVE TGCL1000-GDESC           TO SWCV9991-XDESCCSEND
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-VAL-TAB-BM004-EXIT' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              MOVE 'TGCL1000-CCOD       '    TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(1)
              MOVE  TGCL1000-CCOD            TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
              MOVE 'TGCL1000-GDESC      '    TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(2)
              MOVE  TGCL1000-GDESC           TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(2)
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2100-VAL-TAB-BM004-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF SWCV9990-NMAXLIST EQUAL ZEROES
              MOVE VIAL0001-CAPLIC         TO ARCL0039-CAPLIC
              MOVE VIAL0001-COPCAO         TO ARCL0039-COPCAO
              PERFORM ARCR0039-NMAXLIST
                 THRU ARCR0039-NMAXLIST-EXIT

              IF ETCL0002-ABEND-DB2
                 MOVE ETCL0002-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE ETCL0002-SQLCA       TO VIAL0002-SQLCA
              END-IF

              MOVE ARCL0039-NMAXLIST       TO SWCV9991-NMAXLIST
           ELSE
              MOVE SWCV9990-NMAXLIST       TO SWCV9991-NMAXLIST
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV9991-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV9991-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV9991-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
           MOVE SWCV9991-INDICE            TO VIAL0001-OCORRENCIAS.

       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0016.
           COPY ARCR0039.
           COPY TGCP1000.
           COPY SXCR0790.
           COPY VIAP0020.

